              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸೋದರಸಂಬಂಧಿ — sōdarasambandhi — \"a cousin\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮದುವೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ನನ್ನ ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಸೋದರಸಂಬಂಧಿಗಳನ್ನು ನೋಡಿದೆ. maduveyalli nanna ellā sōdarasambandhigaḷannu nōḍide. I saw all my cousins at the wedding."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ಸೋದರಸಂಬಂಧಿಗಳು, sōdarasambandhigaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Everyday talk often names the exact tie instead: ಮಾವನ ಮಗ, an uncle's son."
            }
          ]
        },
