              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸೋದರಸಂಬಂಧಿ (sōdarasambandhi) is a learned compound built from Sanskrit sodara, \"born of the same womb\", and sambandha, \"close connection; a relative\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
